<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1001I_S000I" variety="S000I">
<name>Door Lock</name>
<ttl id="1001I_S000I_744CK_T004G" variety="T004G">
<name>Power Door Lock System</name>
<para id="RM000002001006X" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="622I9-00" from="200612">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="RM000002001006X_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___000027I00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check</testtitle>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002002006X"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Inspect Large-scale Body Multiplex Communication System [LIN] Communication Function</testtitle>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), perform the communication function inspection of the large-scale body multiplex communication system [LIN] and check that there is no malfunction in the communication system. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000001Z23006X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.21in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.92in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code (ECU not connected, communication line malfunction) not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code (ECU not connected, communication line malfunction) output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Large-scale Body Multiplex Communication System [LIN] section (see <xref label="Seep07" href="RM00000068J00MX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep08" href="RM00000101A00BX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check that no DTCs are output for the master switch (door lock switch) system.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.19in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.94in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code (B2312) not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code (B2312) output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to troubleshooting for the output DTC (see <xref label="Seep09" href="RM00000211U005X"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>List by Symptom</testtitle>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Check whether the symptom is listed in the symptom list. (For the procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep03" href="RM000002009006X"/>.)</ptxt>
</atten4>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.19in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.94in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Not listed in List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Corresponds to List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Inspection Procedure 7</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the following methods based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor/Active Test (see <xref label="Seep04" href="RM000002006005X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep05" href="RM000002004006X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Function Inspection (see <xref label="Seep06" href="RM000002008005X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Component Inspection</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Adjust, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
